WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
(audience cheering)
- Alright y'all,

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.310
sometimes it feels like
there's nothing positive

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.390
on social media, but that is not true.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.470
There's a lot of beauty in the world,

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.700
y'all just have to look for it.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.748
This is "#What I'm Liking".

00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:12.440
(energetic piano music)
(audience clapping)

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.010
Alright, it's no secret
kids love superheroes,

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:17.370
especially in my house, adults as well.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.860
I want you to check
out these photos though

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.533
of a three-year-old girl
in a Spider-Man costume.

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:24.400
(giggles) She's so cute, so adorable,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.680
and her mother cut two
holes on the costume

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.590
so her natural hair would come out.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.360
Those pictures have been
shared nearly 80,000 times

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.700
from everyone from Kerry
Washington to Viola Davis

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.870
to Michael B. Jordan,
they've all commented.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.030
Let's get this mini superhero in here.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.145
Say "Hi" to Rose and her momma Diamond,

00:00:40.145 --> 00:00:40.990
(audience cheering)
I mean Spider-Girl

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:43.332
and her momma Diamond.

00:00:43.332 --> 00:00:44.499
Alright, gosh,

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.880
you are so cute!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.170
So, Diamond, I get the impression

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.870
that Rose does not take
this costume off much.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:55.210
- Correct, at this moment,
it's only to take a bath.

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.470
We saw the Spider-Man
costume one day in Party City

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.590
for Halloween.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.750
So for her birthday I decided to upgrade

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.990
and cut the holes in
it and take the picture

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.150
so she will remember her third birthday,

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.350
how obsessed she was with Spider-Man.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:09.620
- Oh my god, I mean it's so funny,

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.130
literally this looks like my house,

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.160
like my son would be in Spider-Man,

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.490
and my girl would be Gwen
in the Spider-Verse one.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.320
So they're literally going
around just "poof-poof"

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.650
my house like all night long.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:22.500
So why do you think
people responded, though,

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.183
the way they have to the photo?

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.130
- The Afro posts were a big hit.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:29.900
I really think it shows
that you can actually

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.070
be whatever you want to be,

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:35.890
and that Black girls can be
whatever they want to be.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.540
- [Kelly] Absolutely! Oh my
gosh, you little model baby!

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:41.800
She is so, you are so
cute behind that mask

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.830
is what I'm sayin'!
(audience cheering)

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.860
So I feel like, Spider-Girl,

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:47.850
your favorite moves seems

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.510
to be like kinda like
the flock of flyin'...

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.410
What's your favorite superhero move?

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.243
Is it this one?

00:01:53.243 --> 00:01:54.670
- [Diamond] Are you showing it?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.503
- [Kelly] Is that your...

00:01:55.503 --> 00:01:57.013
Yes!
(audience clapping)

00:01:57.013 --> 00:01:58.917
Alright!
(Kelly giggles and claps)

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:01.240
Well, thank you so much Diamond

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.280
and thank you Spider-Girl Rose!

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.980
I'm likin' y'all's post right now.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.314
- [Diamond] Thank you so much.

00:02:06.314 --> 00:02:07.360
(audience clapping)

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.760
- [Kelly] Alright, that's not all.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.210
Our season-long partner
Pilot pen makers of FriXion,

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:13.180
the Go-To Erasable Pen of
"The Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.230
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.660
Angel's looking awesome, she can go,

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.090
you're gonna want this part anyway.

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.930
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars,

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:22.377
how's that sound, Diamond?
(audience cheering)

00:02:22.377 --> 00:02:25.257
- Thank you so much!
(Kelly giggles and claps)

00:02:25.257 --> 00:02:26.790
- [Kelly] You can buy so many

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.840
Spider-Man memorabilia stuff with that.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.022
Thank y'all so much!

00:02:31.022 --> 00:02:34.875
Have a blessed day!
(audience cheering)

